Let me build this with a recursive function:
```java
String print(Zipper z) {
    if (z == null) return "null";
    return "value: " + z.getValue() +
           ", left: " + child(z.left) +
           ", right: " + child(z.right);
}
String child(Zipper z) {
    if (z == null) return "null";
    return "{ " + print(z) + " }";
}
```

